OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric boating lake set to
OL,4,Areopen in the spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hoped that a historic boating
OL,7,Flake which has been closed for several
OL,8,Fyears will reopen next spring.
OL,10,FColchester City Council said it wants
OL,11,Fto bring the lake in Castle Park back
OL,12,Finto use.
OL,14,FPart of the weir in the park collapsed
OL,15,Finto the river in 2023, resulting in
OL,16,Fthe lake's closure.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
