OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric boating lake set to
OL,4,Areopen in the spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Dundas, leader of Colchester City
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "There has been a lot to
OL,8,Fconsider, but we have now reached the
OL,9,Fpoint where we can be clear about our
OL,10,Fambition to restore it and bring it
OL,11,Fback into use."
